00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,515
Pythagoras in the right triangle on the right: a squared equals b sin A squared, plus c minus b cos A squared.

2
00:00:08,515 --> 00:00:09,518
Expand.

3
00:00:09,518 --> 00:00:18,424
The sin squared and cos squared combine into one, and a squared equals b squared plus c squared, minus two b c cos A.

